cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CiteProof in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CiteProof"
abstract: "Audit tools for AI literature reviews. CiteProof checks that a review's citations, quotes, counts and risk-of-bias judgements hold up. It includes an MCP server for research agents and a research assistant app that writes evidence-grounded papers."
